    <episode-num system="onscreen">S20E03</episode-num>
    <episode-num system="pluto">653648a1bdf3cf00088a1915</episode-num>
    <episode-num system="original-air-date">20130101000000 +0000</episode-num>
    <desc>Jeremy, Richard y James conducen a través de España en supercoches de gama media. Clarkson conduce un McLaren 12C Spider, Hammond conduce un Ferrari 458 Spider y May un Audi R8 V10 Spyder.</desc>
    <icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/63048ee5946347001bf27bc1/tile_1774006560964.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=900&amp;q=75&amp;w=900"/>
