  <programme channel="USBD3500032H0" start="20260803234734 +0000" stop="20260804021530 +0000">
    <title>Southpaw</title>
    <desc>Billy "The Great" Hope (Jake Gyllenhaal), the reigning junior middleweight boxing champion, has an impressive career, a loving wife and daughter, and a lavish lifestyle. However, when tragedy strikes, Billy hits rock bottom, losing his family, his house and his manager. He soon finds an unlikely savior in Tick Willis (Forest Whitaker), a former fighter who trains the city's toughest amateur boxers. With his future on the line, Hope fights to reclaim the trust of those he loves the most.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_9729053_15_20260421T160835453Z_113_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-796646965d-p9m6w.jpeg"/>
