  <programme channel="USBD3500032H0" start="20260804021530 +0000" stop="20260804041311 +0000">
    <title>Mechanic: Resurrection</title>
    <desc>Living undercover in Brazil, master assassin Arthur Bishop (Jason Statham) springs back into action after an old enemy (Sam Hazeldine) kidnaps the woman (Jessica Alba) he loves. To save her life, Bishop must kill an imprisoned African warlord, a human trafficker (Toby Eddington) and an arms dealer (Tommy Lee Jones), all while making the deaths look like accidents. When things don't go exactly as planned, Bishop turns the tables on the people who forced him out of retirement.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_30067517_3_20260728T010620399Z_96_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-9468c5484-96k7t.jpeg"/>
