  <programme channel="US4400006IX" start="20260804011856 +0000" stop="20260804022510 +0000">
    <title>My Secret,Terrius Ep.9 (English Dub)</title>
    <desc>Koh Ae-rin, a mom that quit her job a long time ago, starts looking for a job to make a living when her husband suddenly passes away. While doing something no one asked her to at her new job, she finds out a secret of the Korean office of Cornerstone, an international military industrial complex. She gets involved with Kim Bon, the man next door that has been chasing after a huge conspiracy and involuntarily becomes a member of Kingsbag, a special organization within the National Intelligence Service(NIS). She grows rapidly within the world of intelligence, which had seemed like a totally different world to her, and shows great performance that even surprises the NIS agents.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_3000948559_0_20260602T110348976Z_147_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-75df688c49-frrgg.png"/>
