  <channel id="US4300002FK">
    <display-name>Series K Heart</display-name>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/sourcelogo/vc/00/02/34/US4300002FK_20260421T133646SQUARE.png"/>
  </channel>
  <programme channel="US4300002FK" start="20260804002517 +0000" stop="20260804013419 +0000">
    <title>Seoyeong, My Daughter Ep.11</title>
    <desc>It's been 3 years since the last episode... Jiseon has a hard time adjusting to her perfect daughter-in-law... What every other mother-in-law would be happy about, she finds a burden and complains to Gapsun. Meanwhile Hojeong returns from the U.S., bringing back a man with her that she's sure her mother will accept. Migyeong is now dating Sangu and considering marriage whilst Seoyeong has to handle a major case and continues to grow weary of being a judge. Samjae is the one who is truly doing well with himself, having paid of his debts and worked hard to become a decent father. Perhaps he hopes for the day he'll be reunited with his daughter.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_3132778102_0_20260702T025810619Z_94_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-75df688c49-pnt74.png"/>
    <rating>
      <value>TV-14</value>
    </rating>
  </programme>
