    <sub-title>S17, Episode 04</sub-title>
    <desc>On New Year's Day thousands descend on the beach, lifeguards deal with drunk people including one who really doesn't want to get out of the water. When Harries is alerted to a baby not breathing in the car park, he is faced with the biggest challenge of his 28-year career.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_547901337_0_20240922T112419260Z_1_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5dc4fd45f6-8wdfx.jpeg"/>
