    <sub-title>S7, Episode 02</sub-title>
    <desc>Snoop Dogg visits Bondi on New Years. Lifeguards arrive at 5am, rescuing partygoers from rips. One girl loses consciousness, but lifeguard suspect she is a serial offender intentionally endangering herself. The emergency chopper is called for a missing swimmer last seen in the water two hours ago.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_547901337_0_20240922T112419260Z_1_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5dc4fd45f6-8wdfx.jpeg"/>
