    <desc>On the "Namul" episode of "Tales of Hansik," we explore the Korean namul cuisine derived from nature. We discuss the history of namul, edible plants that are blanched, seasoned or stir-fried, as well as the various preparation methods and nutritional benefits of namul.</desc>
