    <desc>Ohio State defeated Utah 48-45 in a high-scoring thriller at the 2022 Rose Bowl, sealing the win with a field goal in the final seconds. Buckeyes wide receiver Jaxon Smith-Njigba had a record-setting performance, with 347 receiving yards and three touchdowns, to lead the second-half comeback.</desc>
