    <title>College Football</title>
    <desc>Penn State defeated Utah 35-21 in the 2023 Rose Bowl, pulling away in the second half with two explosive touchdowns of over 80 yards. The Nittany Lions' victory was secured after Utah quarterback Cameron Rising left the game with an injury in the third quarter, stifling the Utes' offense.</desc>
