    <sub-title>2025 New Jersey Motorsports Park Supersport Race 1</sub-title>
    <desc>Mathew Scholtz dominated to clinch his second consecutive Supersport Championship, but the race was red-flagged after 12 laps due to tire issues. Blake Davis was second over Cameron Petersen, with PJ Jacobsen's tire failing and forcing him to retire.</desc>
