    <sub-title>2025 New Jersey Motorsports Park Supersport Race 2</sub-title>
    <desc>Mathew Scholtz swept the weekend with a commanding 14-second victory. Tyler Scott edged Blake Davis by just .013 of a second for second, with PJ Jacobsen fifth to close out his season.</desc>
