  <programme channel="USBB3500004RC" start="20260804010100 +0000" stop="20260804015201 +0000">
    <title>Project Runway</title>
    <sub-title>Road to the Runway</sub-title>
    <desc>In this season's casting special, "Road to the Runway," sixteen new designers will be introduced with a behind-the-scenes look from their casting auditions  home visits, casting submissions, and sit down interviews. Tim Gunn will present the designers in carefully carved out categories that will lead you into the season premiere.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_550794361_23_20241113T060451474Z_87_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5dc4fd45f6-zsqxt.jpeg"/>
