  <programme channel="USBB3500004RC" start="20260804015201 +0000" stop="20260804024306 +0000">
    <title>Project Runway</title>
    <sub-title>An Unconventional Launch Party</sub-title>
    <desc>Kicking off the season with an Unconventional Materials Challenge, Heidi and Tim welcome the designers at a Season 15 launch party. The designers are shocked to learn that the decor for the party will also serve as their materials for their looks. Savannah Guthrie joins the judging panel.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_550794361_23_20241113T060451474Z_87_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5dc4fd45f6-zsqxt.jpeg"/>
