    <title>Project Runway</title>
    <sub-title>Blacklight or Daylight?</sub-title>
    <desc>The designers have to create a look that sparkles not only in daylight, but also under blacklights on the Runway. Anxieties rise when the unusual materials leave many of the designers in the dark. Jamie King joins the judges this week.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_550794361_23_20241113T060451474Z_87_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5dc4fd45f6-zsqxt.jpeg"/>
