    <title>Project Runway</title>
    <sub-title>Sink or Swim</sub-title>
    <desc>In the Heidi Klum Swimwear Challenge, the designers create their own fabric to use in crafting a stylish swimsuit. The winner will have their design sold as part of Heidi's swimwear line! But the contestants lack of swimsuit experience makes for a harder challenge than expected.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_550794361_23_20241113T060451474Z_87_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5dc4fd45f6-zsqxt.jpeg"/>
