    <title>Project Runway</title>
    <sub-title>There's No "I" in "Team</sub-title>
    <desc>In the season's first Team Challenge, the designers exercise their business savvy when they pitch their collection ideas to raise money from a group of mystery investors. The stakes are raised when they learn that the winning team members will each receive $5,000, and the winner will be featured in Marie Claire magazine!</desc>
