    <title>Project Runway</title>
    <sub-title>There IS Crying in Fashion</sub-title>
    <desc>The designers are excited to attend a press event, but their festive mood is quickly spoiled when the party turns out to be a challenge. The misdirect proves to be more than most of the designers can handle, as many of them have to start their looks over completely when criticized by a disappointed Tim Gunn. Emily Ratajkowski joins the judging panel.</desc>
