    <desc>The exhausted designers are whisked away to Universal Studios Orlando to recharge their batteries with a roller coaster or two. They are then challenged to find inspiration from their experience at the theme park to design a look for the “Urban Jungle.” Guest judge Rebecca Minkoff joins.</desc>
