    </rating>
  </programme>
  <programme channel="USBC4400012QS" start="20260804021519 +0000" stop="20260804024354 +0000">
    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>The Berry Best Biscuit</sub-title>
    <desc>Sour teasing Apple escalates into a "prank war" between the two of them. After the girls' feud disrupts the town, they are sentenced in a Berry Bitty City-style trial to camp alone together for a whole weekend. Miraculously, they emerge best buds, and their friends are relieved, until Sour's influence on Apple turns her into a mini-Sour, and they have to do a personality "makeover" on Apple.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_3109799814_5_20260627T020020660Z_69_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-75df688c49-4pphp.jpeg"/>
