    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>Hot Sauce Cook Off</sub-title>
    <desc>Berrykin Bloom's braggart cousin, Berrykin Bertram, has won the hot sauce competition at the local county fair year after year.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618024203_30_20260304T064131732Z_38_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-8f7lv.jpeg"/>
