  <programme channel="USBC4400012QS" start="20260804031230 +0000" stop="20260804034105 +0000">
    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>The Berry Bitty Dance Disaster</sub-title>
    <desc>When Apple feels left out of a Berryball game and an advanced ballet class, she invents some "groove booties" programmed to dance to any beat. She temporarily impresses her friends with her dance moves, but when the groove booties go out of control and threaten the town's Berryball game, she is forced to fess up.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_3105333668_10_20260626T015430376Z_97_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-75df688c49-pc24j.jpeg"/>
    <rating>
      <value>TV-Y</value>
    </rating>
  </programme>
  <programme channel="USBC4400012QS" start="20260804034105 +0000" stop="20260804040941 +0000">
    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>Dance Puppy Dance</sub-title>
    <desc>When a simple tune Cherry composes goes viral on the Berryweb, Cherry quickly gets fed up with everyone listening to this song, everywhere, all the time. She goes to comic lengths to get some peace so she can compose the song she's suppose to write for the Queen of Berryvania.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618023724_56_20260304T064136423Z_43_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-5nn2x.jpeg"/>
    <rating>
      <value>TV-Y</value>
    </rating>
  </programme>
  <programme channel="USBC4400012QS" start="20260804040941 +0000" stop="20260804043831 +0000">
    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>Fish Out Of Water</sub-title>
    <desc>Strawberry and Orange are dangling their legs in the stream when something tickles Orange's foot. She is sent squealing from the water, certain an eel is after her. Strawberry good-naturedly chuckles at her antics. But Orange gets her dander up and wades into the water to face her "attacker." When she looks down into the water, gazing up at her is the cutest, most adorable, puffy-cheeked fish she's ever seen. It's love at first sight. Orange has to take him home.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618052519_57_20260304T064136451Z_3_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-zrlnq.jpeg"/>
    <rating>
      <value>TV-Y</value>
    </rating>
  </programme>
  <programme channel="USBC4400012QS" start="20260804043831 +0000" stop="20260804050721 +0000">
    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>A Stitch in Time</sub-title>
    <desc>At the next Storytime, Strawberry is going to read a new poem. We see her at the podium as she finishes writing it, one afternoon when no one else is in the café except Custard and Pupcake. Strawberry clears her throat and reads the poem aloud. It's a simple, sweet rhyme about the magic of making wishes on falling stars. She tries a few different rhymes as she goes, noting them on her paper. She is startled to hear applause from Mr. Longface Caterpillar who has heard her recital.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618023928_38_20260304T064132839Z_86_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-p84b2.jpeg"/>
    <rating>
      <value>TV-Y</value>
    </rating>
  </programme>
  <programme channel="USBC4400012QS" start="20260804050721 +0000" stop="20260804053611 +0000">
    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>Babysitter Blues</sub-title>
    <desc>Strawberry Shortcake's friends watch her with wide eyes as she everrrrr-so-gently squirts a layer of blueberry smoothie into a tall glass, trying to not disturb the five other multi-colored layers beneath it. It's her tenth attempt to create the world's first Rainbow Smoothie! She has even painted one wall of her café rainbow colors in honor of the soon-to-be new item on the menu. No one dares breathe for fear of spoiling the delicate touch of a master smoothie-squirter at work.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618168238_28_20260304T064131597Z_138_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-l5ngp.jpeg"/>
    <rating>
      <value>TV-Y</value>
    </rating>
  </programme>
  <programme channel="USBC4400012QS" start="20260804053611 +0000" stop="20260804060501 +0000">
    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>Hair Today Gone Tomorrow</sub-title>
    <desc>It's a busy day at Lemon's salon, a charming place that is more than just a hair salon  it's one of favorite places for Strawberry and her friends to relax and socialize. All the girls are getting their hair done for the gala grand opening of Mr. Longface's new lawn-bowling and croquet club. They're spirited and laughing and chatting and having a great time, as Lemon runs from one of her friends to the next, doing hair and nails, serving tea and cookies.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618052428_69_20260304T064138552Z_67_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-nmqz5.jpeg"/>
    <rating>
      <value>TV-Y</value>
    </rating>
  </programme>
  <programme channel="USBC4400012QS" start="20260804060501 +0000" stop="20260804063351 +0000">
    <title>Strawberry Shortcake</title>
    <sub-title>Pop Goes the Garden</sub-title>
    <desc>Blueberry ordered some Zippy Gro daisy seeds and planted them in her garden. She is surprised that they've sprouted in less than a day despite their descriptive moniker. Strawberry comes by to admire them and Blueberry is reminded that the new cookbook Strawberry ordered has arrived. Strawberry is excited to try out the new corn muffin recipe, as its level of difficulty will be a challenge for her. Strawberry follows the muffin recipe, mixes the ingredients, and double checks it.</desc>
