    <title>Sonic the Hedgehog</title>
    <sub-title>Sonic's Nightmare</sub-title>
    <desc>When Robotnik launches a spy-orb that will uncover the Freedom Fighter's Knothole location, Sonic and Robot launch themselves up to the orbiting spy-sphere aboard a home-made rocket powered by Robotnik's discarded booster engine.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618055698_43_20260304T064133723Z_113_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-w28gm.jpeg"/>
