    <title>Sonic the Hedgehog</title>
    <sub-title>Warp Sonic</sub-title>
    <desc>When Sally uncovers Robotnik's plan to seed the cloud with toxic rain, they attempt a daring mission to sabotage the dirigible-like craft being transported by land vehicles. Mission fails when Sally, Bunnie and Antoine are captured.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618085245_40_20260304T064133437Z_78_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-w6td4.jpeg"/>
