    <title>Sonic the Hedgehog</title>
    <sub-title>Sub-Sonic</sub-title>
    <desc>When Sonic and The Freedom Fighters take out Robotnik's main computer, they're trapped by Swat-Bots in an underground tunnel, only to be rescued by a handsome teenager named Griff. Griff takes them deep beneath the Big City.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618056528_56_20260304T064136423Z_39_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-5nn2x.jpeg"/>
