    <title>Sonic the Hedgehog</title>
    <sub-title>Sonic Past Cool</sub-title>
    <desc>Robotnik severely upsets the ecosystem above and below the surface, when he sends explosive, Robotnik snake probes drilling deep under ground in search of oil lakes.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618055786_85_20260304T064141280Z_34_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-7jpth.jpeg"/>
