    <sub-title>Heads or Tails</sub-title>
    <desc>Tails brings a new friend home to Knothole - a baby Terra-Pod who has strayed from the herd that is currently migrating. Sonic, Sally, and some of the other Freedom Fighters return the Baby-T to its mom and the rest of the herd.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618085239_84_20260304T064141183Z_1_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-qj7j7.jpeg"/>
