    <title>Sonic the Hedgehog</title>
    <sub-title>Sonic Conversion</sub-title>
    <desc>Sonic reluctantly takes Tails with him to the Big City to find some cotter pins for the Freedom Fighters catapults. While in the City, Sonic is nearly eaten alive by his old dog Muttski, now a roboti-sized guard dog in the Junk Heaps</desc>
