    <title>Rev and Roll</title>
    <sub-title>In Deep Doo-Doo // Rev's Tree Party</sub-title>
    <desc>When Rev asks to help beautify the town, he insists there's no job too tough! That is...until he finds out he'll be hauling stinky manure. Rev tries to pawn the job off, until Avery tells him the best way to get it done is to just... "doo-doo" it! // When the gang organizes a birthday party for Rev, Avery insists they keep it secret. After hiding Rev's gifts in a tree, they realize the presents are stuck up there and will need to be retrieved-all before Rev figures out what's going on!</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618085141_50_20260304T064134283Z_37_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-4jtsx.jpeg"/>
