    <sub-title>Driving Miss Dottie // Follow the Bouncing Wrecking Ball</sub-title>
    <desc>When Miss Dottie goes missing, Rev and Avery offer to return her to the Rancher's Jamboree! Rumble is star-struck by the show-sheep, until the unlikely duo become friends. Back safe, Miss Dottie takes the stage, this time with her new pal Rumble! // Rev is determined to master Rumble's new wrecking-ball attachment, but things quickly get out of hand when the duo refuse to ask for help. Now they'll need all the help they can get to stop the wayward ball from wrecking all of Fender Bend!</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618027302_63_20260304T064137328Z_51_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-zslhb.jpeg"/>
