    <title>Rev and Roll</title>
    <sub-title>Pond Pirates // The Coolest Girl I Know</sub-title>
    <desc>When Rev's dad tells about him about treasure sunken in the pond, Rev and Avery set out on a pirate adventure! They outfit Rumble and Alley with new dive equipment to salvage the long-lost toys and cherished memories found within the chest. // When Rev's cousin Katie comes to visit, Avery's jealousy gets the best of her-Avery always thought she was the coolest girl Rev knew! Intent on outdoing Katie, Avery pulls a stunt that she comes to regret.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618027300_54_20260304T064139720Z_87_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-ntwwh.jpeg"/>
