    <title>Rev and Roll</title>
    <sub-title>Gear Up Garage Band // First Aid Fun</sub-title>
    <desc>At band practice, Rumble struggles to control his nervous backfiring, even damaging the instruments by accident! Determined not to give up on the festival, the gang improvises and uses makeshift instruments. They even feature Rumble's nervous twitch! // When Rev and Owen begrudgingly agree to join Bo's First Aid Games, they do everything BUT take the lessons seriously. It isn't long before the boys find out that first aid isn't all fun and games, but it IS totally awesome!</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618027295_21_20260304T064129393Z_107_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-zqhjs.jpeg"/>
