    <title>Rev and Roll</title>
    <sub-title>Fender Bend Friend Day // The Rev &amp; Rumble Fan Club</sub-title>
    <desc>Rev wants to surprise his friends with a movie celebrating their friendship, so he secretly gathers footage to show they're the best friends ever. When Avery realizes what he's up to, she adds her own clips to the movie - surprising Rev as well! // Owen hosts a virtual review of the gang's adventures with Rev and Rumble, plus all of their awesome gear! He walks his viewers through some of their most memorable moments, from mega stunts to monsters to rescue missions.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618055353_48_20260304T064134184Z_83_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-jvtln.jpeg"/>
