    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>Dolphin Dilemma // Ruby and the Beast</sub-title>
    <desc>A Flower Festival is underway in Rainbow Village and Ling Ling has called Rainbow Ruby to help her judge the "best flower" contest. But just as Rainbow Ruby starts looking around at the flowers, Kiki's pet dog Pom Pom starts acting unusual and running around frantically, destroying the festival! // Gina and Jessy are with a huge fish that's injured by the lake. Rainbow Ruby becomes a Marine Biologist. Rainbow Ruby uses her encyclopedia to find out that the fish is actually a dolphin.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618026616_62_20260304T064137147Z_24_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-wxlgb.jpeg"/>
