    <sub-title>Hat Trick // Dancing on the Ice</sub-title>
    <desc>Everyone is frightened because some visiting birds keep trying to sit on their heads. According to Chirpee, the birds just enjoy sitting on people's heads. Rainbow Ruby designs hats where the birds can comfortably sit without disturbing the villagers. // The village friends were planning to have some fun with the rainbow fish but they're all disappointed to discover that the lake has frozen over.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618054922_80_20260304T064140791Z_114_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-z2fx8.jpeg"/>
