    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>When the Moon was Missing // Trouble in a Bubble</sub-title>
    <desc>The friends are very tired because Mr. Moon hasn't come to sing them their nightly lullaby. Rainbow Ruby uses her magic suitcase to become an Astronaut and flies to space to look for Mr. Moon with her friends. // In Rainbow Village, a super frantic Thunderbell is high up in the air, trapped inside a giant bubble. Thunderbell got trapped in a giant bubble in the middle of a bubble bath. In order to find out a way to bring Thunderbell back to earth, Rainbow Ruby turns into a scientist.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618026706_6_20260304T064125951Z_1_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"/>
