    <sub-title>Home Sweet Home // Mixed Berries</sub-title>
    <desc>Gina accidentally broke Felicia's house, leaving Felicia homeless. Rainbow Ruby uses her magic suitcase to become an architect and builds a house that suits Felicia's demands. // Gina is extremely worried. She needs strawberries for the Rainbow Fruit Ice Cream Festival that's starting soon but the strawberries are all mixed in with other red objects.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618026620_6_20260304T064125951Z_27_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"/>
