    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>Blast Off // The True Jewel</sub-title>
    <desc>Ling Ling takes Rainbow Ruby to Ellie's cabin where she meets mischievous baby stars that fell from the sky. The baby stars were playing together, got separated from their mother and ended up in Rainbow Village. // Kiki is extremely upset because the jewel Prince Frederick gave her as a gift broke. The friends try to glue the broken pieces together but it doesn't work. Rainbow Ruby uses her magic suitcase to become a jewelry designer and tries designing jewelry with the broken pieces.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618025343_19_20260304T064128464Z_111_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-z2fx8.jpeg"/>
