    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>Ruby's Ranger Adventure // The Show Must Go On</sub-title>
    <desc>When Ruby and Choco arrive at the village, they find a very worried looking Ling Ling. Gina, Ellie, and Thunderbell went camping in Rainbow Forest but they saw a monster in the forest, got scared and had to run away. // Ruby is struggling to make a doll with her dad. Ruby and Choco get their suitcase and as Ruby swings her umbrella, there they are, in front of Rainbow fountain. Mayor Ling Ling tells her that today is the day of Princess Kiki's ballet performance.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618055179_44_20260304T064133873Z_20_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-qj7j7.jpeg"/>
