    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>Shoe Crazy // Picture This</sub-title>
    <desc>Ruby is looking at shoes that are now too small for her but she is unwilling to throw away. Ling Ling is worried about Thunderbell. His scooter broke so he is not able to carry out his work as a mail carrier. // Gina calls Rainbow Ruby because today is the day to show their appreciation to Mayor Ling Ling. It took a long time for the village friends to prepare an amazing painting for the mayor. Unfortunately, Thunderbell accidentally destroyed the painting while delivering it.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618025432_53_20260304T064135008Z_85_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-x2xgk.jpeg"/>
