    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>At Your Service // A Hard Rain</sub-title>
    <desc>There is a new menu at the restaurant, which is very popular. There is a long line in front of the restaurant but there weren't enough staff members to serve the villagers the food. Rainbow Ruby turns into a waitress using her magic suitcase and serve tables kindly. // Rainbow Village is full of marbles. The marbles that Rainbow Ruby spilled in her room poured down into the village from up above the sky! Rainbow Ruby uses her magic suitcase to transform into a paramedic.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618026701_5_20260304T064125687Z_33_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-mncfr.jpeg"/>
