    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>Moon Cake Madness // Trunk Trouble</sub-title>
    <desc>Gina, Thunderbell, and Choco try to cheer Jessy up but their efforts are of no use. While talking to Mayor Ling Ling, Rainbow Ruby realizes that today is the day that Jessy first arrived in Rainbow Village! Jessy was upset that her friends forgot such a meaningful day to her. // Ling Ling has caught a bad cold and was sneezing all over the place. Rainbow Ruby uses her magic suitcase and transforms into a doctor and cares for him.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618026695_5_20260304T064125687Z_46_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-mncfr.jpeg"/>
