  <programme channel="USBD3300015BY" start="20260804054546 +0000" stop="20260804061141 +0000">
    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>Behind the Scenes // Paperdoll in Peril</sub-title>
    <desc>Ling Ling is worried about the play planned for tonight. There are no costumes ready for the villagers so it's hard to figure out which roles they're playing. Rainbow Ruby transforms into a costume designer and designs costumes for her friends. // It is very windy in Rainbow village and Paige, a paper doll, is flying to wherever the wind takes her. She is so light that she is blown away by the wind. Rainbow Ruby uses her magic suitcase to become a fire fighter and rescue Paige.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618054918_70_20260304T064138879Z_109_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-gfmfr.jpeg"/>
