  <programme channel="USBD3300015BY" start="20260804061141 +0000" stop="20260804063736 +0000">
    <title>Rainbow Ruby</title>
    <sub-title>Singing in the Rain // Mail Carrier Mayhem</sub-title>
    <desc>Ling Ling is worried that the villagers are all in low spirits. Ruby thinks of fun games to play but the villagers say that they have already played all of the games too many times. Rainbow Ruby transforms into a singer. // Ling Ling is worried because of the "Secret Present Swapping Party" that Thunderbell is preparing. Thunderbell forgot to send out the invitations. Rainbow Ruby turns into a mail carrier and delivers the invitations.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2618025342_51_20260304T064134877Z_41_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-l8ntt.jpeg"/>
