  <programme channel="USBC44000072I" start="20260804003137 +0000" stop="20260804013456 +0000">
    <title>Blippi's Adventure and Discovery Tour</title>
    <desc>Join Blippi as he embarks on an exciting Adventure and Discovery Tour! Explore the fascinating jobs at Wimbledon, enjoy a fun-filled game of Mini Golf, and cheer on your favorite team at Liverpool FC. Watch Blippi get hands-on with recycling in Smash My Trash, and meet Stanley the Dinosaur for a roaring good time. Each adventure is packed with fun, learning, and new discoveries, making every moment with Blippi an unforgettable experience for kids.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_918247335_0_20250227T222341362Z_26_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b76dd9bbb-z2cj4.jpeg"/>
