  <programme channel="USBC44000072I" start="20260804013456 +0000" stop="20260804023833 +0000">
    <title>Blippi's Learning and Exploration Journey</title>
    <desc>Set off on a Learning and Exploration Journey with Blippi as he dives into the world of construction vehicles, exploring bulldozers and excavators up close! Discover the wonders of a Children's Museum and learn through play at the Cayton Children's Museum. Get a splash of color and knowledge as Blippi teaches kids about plants and colors in a fun and engaging way. These educational adventures are perfect for curious young minds, making learning exciting and interactive with Blippi.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_918223973_0_20250227T222341362Z_1_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b76dd9bbb-z2cj4.jpeg"/>
