    <title>I Want Cake!</title>
    <desc>Sid and his friends discover that only eating cake would make their bodies feel terrible. Then they explore and learn that the best way to stay healthy is by eating nutritious food.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_841701687_0_20250213T052212597Z_30_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b76dd9bbb-9jfq9.jpeg"/>
