    <title>Tarzan and Jane</title>
    <sub-title>Genesis</sub-title>
    <desc>Tarzan, rescued by Kala and given supernatural powers, defends the jungle from threats. Discovered by his grandfather's expedition, he meets Jane and returns to London. There, they uncover a plot to steal exotic animals, leading Tarzan and Jane to thwart the villains and save the animals.</desc>
