  <channel id="USBD35000149S">
    <display-name>Stingray Nothin' But 90s</display-name>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/sourcelogo/vc/00/02/34/USBD35000149S_20260421T143145SQUARE.png"/>
  </channel>
  <programme channel="USBD35000149S" start="20260804000000 +0000" stop="20260804020000 +0000">
    <title>Stingray Nothin' But '90s</title>
    <desc>The ‘90s was a decade like no other. Grunge, pop, hip-hop, and contemporary country music battled it out on the charts. This mix samples the variety of genres from this unforgettable era.</desc>
