    <title>ART After Dark</title>
    <sub-title>Black Gaze—Part 2</sub-title>
    <desc>A tribute to the richness of black culture. Through a myriad of mediums, this collection encapsulates the resilience, beauty, and innovation of black artists worldwide, weaving a narrative that echoes the rich tapestry of their collective heritage.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_1738072437_0_20250723T184550993Z_39_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-d7c8c765b-6x9bf.jpeg"/>
