    <title>ART After Dark</title>
    <sub-title>Eyes on the East—Part 1</sub-title>
    <desc>Immerse yourself in a vibrant tapestry of Asian American and Pacific Islander culture, where each piece resonates with the depth and diversity of this dynamic community, and mid-tempo melodies lull and transport you to an adventure of the Far East.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_1738160959_0_20250723T184544461Z_3_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-d7c8c765b-6x9bf.jpeg"/>
