    <sub-title>Tranquil Impressions—Part 2</sub-title>
    <desc>Experience a serene and evocative art collection designed to provide a peaceful retreat from the chaos of daily life. This collection inspires calm, wonder, and awe, offering a soothing escape that captivates the soul and rejuvenates the spirit.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_1738102164_1_20250723T184544364Z_19_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-d7c8c765b-qc6z9.jpeg"/>
