    <title>ARTspiration</title>
    <sub-title>Featured Artists—Dennis Miller</sub-title>
    <desc>Experience the abstract motion art of Dennis Miller, a visual artist with a composer's background. He translates musical principles like rhythm and structure into imagery, transforming photographs into emotionally deep, non-representational works of art.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2362365019_0_20260101T155841004Z_1_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-sf6r8.jpeg"/>
