    <title>ARTspiration</title>
    <sub-title>Featured Artists—Jennifer Panepinto</sub-title>
    <desc>Explore the floral motion art of Jennifer Panepinto (QuantumSpirit). Her work blends AI and digital editing to explore memory and consciousness through bold color, intricate texture, and symbolic motifs. A visually textured, emotionally resonant collection.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2732400675_0_20260331T155557912Z_19_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-796646965d-pnqz4.jpeg"/>
