    <desc>An evolving collection of motion artwork by Joe Winograd, exploring the surreal atmosphere of the ‘late night' state of mind. Winograd's captivating visuals transport viewers into a dreamlike realm where time feels fluid, blending imagination with the quiet mystery of the night.</desc>
